that walks a candidate list in precedence order (=~/aiActivityTemplates=,
then =/bisos/apps/defaults/ai-templates=) and returns the first existing
path as a resolved absolute string, or None. User-first ordering: a
personal clone at =~/aiActivityTemplates= wins over the BISOS system
copy even when both are present. Uses =pathlib.Path(...).expanduser()=
for tilde resolution and stores the expanded absolute path.
