on this BISOS machine (no =~/aiActivityTemplates=, BISOS path present),
the function returns =/bisos/apps/defaults/ai-templates= (fallback
correct); running =aiActivity.cs -i userConfig_get --parName=templates=
through the CLI returns the same. Precedence path (both exist) not
directly testable on this machine but the loop order guarantees it.

