Looks at end of symlink of AI-WORKFLOW.org if it exists and determines --templates base.
If ./.aiActivity.cs does not exist create it and record it.
If AI-WORKPLAN.org does not exist look at AI-Activity.org end of symlink.
The above applies to exisiting dirs. Moving forward we will be doing this at initiate and initiateSub.
----- AI Results: ------
Added two reusable helpers and one new Cmnd class in
=py3/bin/aiActivity.cs=:

- =_deduceCwdConfig(targetDir)= --- returns =(templatesBase, activity)=
  by reading =AI-WORKFLOW.org= and =AI-Activity.org= symlink targets.
  =AI-WORKFLOW.org= target's parent's parent is the templates base;
  =AI-Activity.org= target's parent name is the activity; the same
  target's parent's parent is a fallback for =templatesBase= when
  =AI-WORKFLOW.org= is absent. Returns =(None, None)= when neither
  symlink exists.
- =_recordCwdConfig(templatesBase, activity)= --- writes both to
  cwdConfig via =cwdConfig_csu.parSet=, skipping =None= fields and
  writing only when the stored value would change. Returns a list of
  human-readable notes (=cwdConfig: templates=X= or =cwdConfig:
  templates unchanged (X)=) for the caller to report. Idempotent.
- =cwdConfig_record= Cmnd class --- no params, no args. Runs on
  =pathlib.Path.cwd()=, calls =_deduceCwdConfig=, then
  =_recordCwdConfig=, reports notes via =b_io.ann.note=. Refuses with
  a clear message if neither symlink is found ("Nothing to deduce.
  Run 'initiate' here first."). Placed between =refresh= and
  =deClaudify= in the source file.

Examples menu grew a new chapter for =cwdConfig_record= between
=refresh= and =deClaudify=.

Verified end-to-end:
- Fresh-initiated dir has =activity= in cwdConfig but not =templates=
  (current pre-TODO-3 behaviour). Running =cwdConfig_record= writes
  =templates= (deduced from =AI-WORKFLOW.org=) and reports =activity
  unchanged=.
- Idempotent second run reports both as unchanged.
- With =AI-WORKFLOW.org= deleted but =AI-Activity.org= symlink intact,
  fallback deduces both correctly from just =AI-Activity.org='s
  target.
- Empty directory (no symlinks) refuses with the "Nothing to deduce"
  message; no traceback.

The =_recordCwdConfig= helper is reusable for TODO 3 which will wire
it into =initiate= and =initiateSub= to auto-record on every install.


